loom scan runs_recorded=109 runs_red=1 runs_seconds_total=108 runs_seconds_absent=102 slowest=dated_path:64
loom qa reds=A+ composite=100 itinerary=A+ composite=100 log=A+ composite=100 run_sh=A+ scan_sh=A+
loom hot_close guards=20 green=20 red=0 first_red=reds_status_consistency_repaired reds_pin_bytes=24508
file tools/fixtures/s/standing_equipment_run.sh two date calls bracket each guard; elapsed seconds land as the card's sixth field and as guards_seconds at the close
file tools/fixtures/s/standing_equipment_scan.sh reads that field into runs_seconds_total, runs_seconds_absent and runs_slowest; elder rows count absent, a zero-second guard still claims the seat
file tools/fixtures/s/standing_equipment_control.sh twelve behaviors for the field, both ways, and two end-anchored tier greps relaxed to admit it
file tools/s/standing_equipment_witness.rish thirteen asserts for the new control keys
file construction/REDS.md %390 the cost the roster never recorded, %391 the pin that opened on its oldest shelf; %386 and %387 folded to make the room they needed
file session-logs/README.md the oldest shelf row moves to the foot, where its range puts it
file construction/ITINERARY.md the measured roster reading replaces the estimate; the REDS pin's 89 bytes named as the next door
file construction/archive/REDS-the-instrument-that-could-not-measure-itself-rows-386-387.md the shelf the fold needed, and what the two rows teach together
