recommend keep-going -- THE ROSTER NOW RECORDS WHAT IT COSTS, so the next lap sizes its own pass from 108 measured rows rather than from a window it watched, and the finding worth carrying is that the cost is not merely uneven but skewed fifteen to one, median against mean, which is why every window anyone sampled disagreed with every other. MINE NEXT is this card's remaining recording blocks; the REDS fold this lap needed is done, and the pin stands at 22,023 of 24,576. YOUR GATES ARE WHERE THEY WERE, and one is sharper now: %374 asks whether `--scoped` may chain from a close whose only reds are custody-gated, and this clone's answer is that `rule_twin` at %7 is the single red standing between it and a 55-minute pass becoming a 30-second one.
